mw2coop patch for maps/gulag.gsc (The Gulag, Modern Warfare 2, 64-bit Steam build)
Co-op logic lives in mw2coop/scripts/maps/_mw2coop_gulag.gsc.

1. Landing: player 2 gets off the helicopter with player 1.
@@@ replace
	level.player_view_controller Delete();
	ent Delete();
@@@ with
	level.player_view_controller Delete();
	ent Delete();
	level thread maps\_mw2coop_gulag::partner_leaves_heli(); // (its 0.2 s step out of the door runs beside player 1's)
@@@ end

2. Enemies cannot hit "the player" in the bathroom and rescue scenes: both players
   (maps\_mw2coop::players_attackeraccuracy), the partner is in the same scene.
@@@ subst gulag_bathroom
level.player.attackeraccuracy = 0;
@@@ to
maps\_mw2coop::players_attackeraccuracy( 0 );
@@@ end
@@@ subst gulag_rescue
level.player.attackeraccuracy = 0;
@@@ to
maps\_mw2coop::players_attackeraccuracy( 0 );
@@@ end

3. The riot shield draws enemies' fire to whoever carries it: each player has his own watcher
   (maps\gulag_code::player_riotshield_threatbias on self, player 1 alone outside co-op).
@@@ subst main
	thread player_riotshield_threatbias();
@@@ to
	foreach ( mw2coop_player in level.players )
		mw2coop_player thread player_riotshield_threatbias();
@@@ end

4. The explosion in the night-vision hallway after the cell block (gulag_rappel; night audit 2026-11-17) knocks down every player in its
   earthquake (5000 units from player 1): the shell shock, prone and the rumble. Player 2 stayed up and unshocked.
@@@ subst gulag_rappel
level.player delayCall( 0.5, ::ShellShock, "gulag_attack", 5, false );
	level.player delayCall( 0.6, ::setstance, "prone" );
@@@ to
foreach ( mw2coop_player in level.players )
	{
		if ( Distance( mw2coop_player.origin, level.player.origin ) > 5000 )
			continue;
		mw2coop_player delayCall( 0.5, ::ShellShock, "gulag_attack", 5, false );
		mw2coop_player delayCall( 0.6, ::setstance, "prone" );
		if ( mw2coop_player != level.player )
		{
			mw2coop_player PlayRumbleLoopOnEntity( "damage_heavy" );
			mw2coop_player delayCall( 2, ::StopRumble, "damage_heavy" );
		}
	}
@@@ end

5. The armory fight's breather (gulag_armory): random bullets miss both players while the level saves, not player 1 alone; their
   accuracy against them goes with maps\_utility::set_player_attacker_accuracy (_utility.gsc.patch hunk 8).
@@@ subst gulag_armory
level.player.ignorerandombulletdamage = true;
@@@ to
foreach ( mw2coop_player in level.players )
		mw2coop_player.ignorerandombulletdamage = true;
@@@ end
@@@ subst gulag_armory
level.player.ignorerandombulletdamage = false;
@@@ to
foreach ( mw2coop_player in level.players )
		mw2coop_player.ignorerandombulletdamage = false;
@@@ end
